00:40:03.510 --> 00:40:04.379
I want more government.

00:40:04.380 --> 00:40:05.489
And then they're facing a

00:40:05.490 --> 00:40:07.889
frustration. So in that in the UK,

00:40:07.890 --> 00:40:10.469
if you're the death of a loved one,

00:40:10.470 --> 00:40:12.569
previously you had to notify already

00:40:12.570 --> 00:40:15.539
over 40 different agencies

00:40:15.540 --> 00:40:17.339
