00:40:19.710 --> 00:40:21.959
You're grieving for a loved one.

00:40:21.960 --> 00:40:23.909
They switched it to a process

00:40:23.910 --> 00:40:25.469
using digital government called Tell

00:40:25.470 --> 00:40:26.399
US once.

00:40:26.400 --> 00:40:27.599
Now you just have to tell the

00:40:27.600 --> 00:40:29.309
