00:40:29.310 --> 00:40:31.049
they get information out to all

00:40:31.050 --> 00:40:32.609
these all the other agencies.

00:40:32.610 --> 00:40:34.649
And increasingly, I think,

00:40:34.650 --> 00:40:35.999
you know, the leading governments in

00:40:36.000 --> 00:40:38.399
the world around innovation

00:40:38.400 --> 00:40:40.259
and things like Estonia, Singapore,

00:40:40.260 --> 00:40:41.849
trying to figure out they're talk of

00:40:41.850 --> 00:40:43.799
