00:40:47.610 --> 00:40:49.949
events. When you lose a job

00:40:49.950 --> 00:40:51.779
or you're going on to college or

00:40:51.780 --> 00:40:52.579
the birth of a.

00:40:52.580 --> 00:40:54.309
Child, the death of a loved one, how

00:40:54.310 --> 00:40:56.259
we organize services

00:40:56.260 --> 00:40:57.039
around that.

00:40:57.040 --> 00:40:58.869
Again, to reduce all of that

00:40:58.870 --> 00:41:00.879
friction that currently exists

00:41:00.880 --> 00:41:02.409
in the effort and the system.

00:41:02.410 --> 00:41:04.179
And now with AI and digital

00:41:04.180 --> 00:41:05.379
government, we really have the

00:41:05.380 --> 00:41:07.299
ability to turbo charge that

00:41:07.300 --> 00:41:08.919
more than we've ever seen before.

00:41:08.920 --> 00:41:11.289
Who who are the politicians

00:41:11.290 --> 00:41:13.209
in America who you think

00:41:13.210 --> 00:41:14.829
