where government helps, but it's not

00:41:31.630 --> 00:41:33.749
on the you know, it

00:41:33.750 --> 00:41:35.649
it a lot of different people, a lot

00:41:35.650 --> 00:41:36.699
of different innovation is

00:41:36.700 --> 00:41:37.749
happening.

