Well, I think when we look at

00:41:39.570 --> 00:41:40.629
it from a bridge building

00:41:40.630 --> 00:41:41.630
standpoint,

00:41:42.670 --> 00:41:44.499
government politicians who

00:41:44.500 --> 00:41:46.179
