00:44:23.590 --> 00:44:25.419
What was what you know,

00:44:25.420 --> 00:44:26.349
what did Hogan do?

00:44:26.350 --> 00:44:28.089
And he's always being floated as

00:44:28.090 --> 00:44:30.249
like a third, you know, a No Labels

00:44:30.250 --> 00:44:31.959
type candidate, etc..

