But the takeaway is problem

00:44:44.470 --> 00:44:46.539
solving, focus on solving

00:44:46.540 --> 00:44:48.999
problems. He was very pragmatic.

00:44:49.000 --> 00:44:50.259
The state was run well.

00:44:50.260 --> 00:44:51.609
They had a lot of innovation in

00:44:51.610 --> 00:44:53.349
areas like workforce development,

00:44:53.350 --> 00:44:54.849
which is a huge issue in the.

00:44:54.850 --> 00:44:55.329
Way.

00:44:55.330 --> 00:44:57.069
Among most governors.

00:44:57.070 --> 00:44:58.569
The notion of upskilling the

00:44:58.570 --> 00:45:00.639
workforce to meet 21st century

00:45:00.640 --> 00:45:03.039
needs, whether it's in AI

00:45:03.040 --> 00:45:05.019
