00:45:05.020 --> 00:45:06.369
is really one of their most

00:45:06.370 --> 00:45:07.989
important topics.

00:45:07.990 --> 00:45:10.299
Areas of issue

00:45:10.300 --> 00:45:12.249
orient. And what Hogan did

00:45:12.250 --> 00:45:13.689
as governor was they had something

00:45:13.690 --> 00:45:15.879
called Earned Maryland,

00:45:15.880 --> 00:45:17.679
which in contrast to most workforce

00:45:17.680 --> 00:45:18.639
development programs, it was

00:45:18.640 --> 00:45:20.739
industry led, which

00:45:20.740 --> 00:45:22.239
meant that they said, you know,

00:45:22.240 --> 00:45:24.339
industry knows a lot better

00:45:24.340 --> 00:45:26.169
than we do as government officials

00:45:26.170 --> 00:45:27.579
what their needs are.

00:45:27.580 --> 00:45:29.649
And so we're going to let

00:45:29.650 --> 00:45:31.989
