00:45:38.410 --> 00:45:40.299
things. And they're going to they're

00:45:40.300 --> 00:45:41.889
going to create the curriculum and

00:45:41.890 --> 00:45:42.669
they're going to change it. We're

00:45:42.670 --> 00:45:44.049
going to let them be very agile

00:45:44.050 --> 00:45:45.699
depending on the very changing

00:45:45.700 --> 00:45:47.289
workforce needs.

00:45:47.290 --> 00:45:48.459
And that was just what and it was

00:45:48.460 --> 00:45:50.469
very successful program we talk

00:45:50.470 --> 00:45:52.599
